> Windows NT has PALcode embedded in it somehow?

Windows NT has god only knows what embedded in it.  We all know where
Digital has been taking it from them since the beginning.  Alpha's even
have a PeeCee DRAM-refreshtimer-speakerbeeper in them, no?  i'm feeling
